#
# Operator override for the stage unit. Copy this file, set SHA to the
# release directory name under /opt/galion/voice/release/, then render.
# The unit template Description stays free of a commit hash.
# scripts/deploy/render-stage-unit.sh reads SHA= and writes the drop-in.
# The gateway key is not set in this drop-in. The unit template comments
# GALION_LLM_KEY_FILE and GALION_LLM_KEY_NAME. GALION_LLM_KEY is the fallback.
# Do not write the key here.
SHA=
